  "prefLabel": "Per 102.95 Temporary assignment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.95 “Temporary assignment” means an assignment of a qualified candidate to a position that is known or anticipated to be of limited duration.\n\nSource. #5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; renumbered by #10238 (Per 102.62); renumbered by #10801 (from Per 102.64); ss by #13667, eff 6-22-23 (formerly Per 102.70); renumbered by #14065-A; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.85), eff 12-1-25",
